WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.770 line:82% align:center
If you spent an
hour saying nothing,

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:05.822 line:82% align:center
no amount of clipping
finds the moment,

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:08.498 line:82% align:center
because the moment
is not in there.

00:00:08.922 --> 00:00:10.890 line:82% align:center
This is amplification,
not creation.

00:00:12.066 --> 00:00:13.971 line:82% align:center
But if you did say
something real,

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:16.352 line:82% align:center
the difference between
that landing and

00:00:16.352 --> 00:00:18.607 line:82% align:center
that disappearing
is almost entirely

00:00:18.607 --> 00:00:19.357 line:82% align:center
mechanical.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.742 line:82% align:center
And mechanical problems
have mechanical

00:00:21.742 --> 00:00:22.492 line:82% align:center
solutions.
